  "caption": "Calibration envelopes for repeat 003, using every original cap-feasible candidate in twelve environments per cell. The separate-error factor is (1+\u03b7)/(1\u2212\u03b7), while the paired factor is exp(\u03b4). The dashed 5% line is the nonempty-set boundary for a uniform factor against the minimum-mean reference. Both are empirical envelopes. BLAST has singleton pools, so its near-zero paired residual does not demonstrate useful admission.",
